---
// Where a failure is reported with and without t.Helper(). Lines come from the two outputs in the post.
const panels = [
  { x: 20, titleEn: 'With t.Helper()', titleVi: 'Có t.Helper()', hot: 1, out: 'port_test.go:22: Parse("443") = 443, want 80' },
  { x: 470, titleEn: 'Without t.Helper()', titleVi: 'Không có t.Helper()', hot: 2, out: 'port_test.go:15: Parse("443") = 443, want 80' },
];
const bw = 410;
---
<figure class="p06c">
  <div class="p06c-scroll">
  <svg viewBox="0 0 900 270" role="img" aria-label="TestHelpers calls wantPort on line 22, and wantPort calls t.Errorf on line 15. With t.Helper() the failure is reported at line 22. Without it, at line 15.">
    {panels.map((p) => (
      <g>
        <text x={p.x} y="22" class="h"><tspan data-lang-en>{p.titleEn}</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>{p.titleVi}</tspan></text>
        <rect x={p.x} y="44" width={bw} height="56" rx="6" class={p.hot === 1 ? 'hot' : 'box'} />
        <text x={p.x + 14} y="66" class="b">TestHelpers</text>
        <text x={p.x + 14} y="88" class="s">line 22: wantPort(t, "443", 80)</text>
        <path d={`M ${p.x + 40} 100 L ${p.x + 40} 126`} class="ln" />
        <polygon points={`${p.x + 40},134 ${p.x + 35},125 ${p.x + 45},125`} class="ah" />
        <text x={p.x + 56} y="122" class="s"><tspan data-lang-en>calls</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>gọi</tspan></text>
        <rect x={p.x} y="138" width={bw} height="56" rx="6" class={p.hot === 2 ? 'hot' : 'box'} />
        <text x={p.x + 14} y="160" class="b">wantPort</text>
        <text x={p.x + 14} y="182" class="s">line 15: t.Errorf(...)</text>
        <text x={p.x + bw - 14} y={p.hot === 1 ? 72 : 166} text-anchor="end" class="r"><tspan data-lang-en>reported</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>dòng được báo</tspan></text>
        <text x={p.x} y="232" class="m"><tspan data-lang-en>Output:</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Kết quả:</tspan></text>
        <text x={p.x} y="254" class="b">{p.out}</text>
      </g>
    ))}
  </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>The failure is raised inside the helper either way. t.Helper() tells Go to skip that frame and report the line that called it, the one you need to edit.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Dù có hay không, lỗi vẫn phát sinh bên trong helper. t.Helper() bảo Go bỏ qua frame đó và báo dòng đã gọi nó, tức là dòng bạn cần sửa.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .p06c { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .p06c-scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
  .p06c svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 640px; height: auto; }
  .p06c text { font-size: 14px; fill: var(--text-body); }
  .p06c .h { font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .p06c .b { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .p06c .m { fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .p06c .s { font-size: 13px; fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .p06c .r { fill: var(--red); font-weight: 700; }
  .p06c .box { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .p06c .skip { fill: none; stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.2; stroke-dasharray: 4 3; }
  .p06c .hot { fill: var(--red-tint-bg); stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 1.4; }
  .p06c .ln { stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.5; fill: none; }
  .p06c .ln.cut { stroke-dasharray: 3 4; opacity: 0.5; }
  .p06c .ah { fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .p06c .rule { stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1; }
  .p06c .grid { stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1; }
  .p06c figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.55; text-align: center; }
</style>
